        "read": false,
        "user_title": "",
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "Sentinels of the Multiverse: Shattered Timelines is now available! This expansion brings two time-traveling heroes, four awful (yet familiar) villains, and two time-displaced environments! Experience the alternate realities that make up the Multiverse!\r\nCan you repair time before it runs out?!\r\n\r\nFrom the Sentinels website \r\nMy question is ... what part of time are we repairing as we play sentinels?\r\n\r\nIs the main one visionary saving the dreamer... which makes sense\r\n\r\nbut what about the Iron Legacy timeline ... is that just a WHAT IF timeline? if so it can be completely ignored or did the actual (main timeline) heroes interact with this time line ... if so how? we haven't seen any dimension hoping characters? and who restored the timeline? or is this a spoiler to a future hero?\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nOr am I thinking too hard about a game based on comic book conventions ?",
