        "raw": "<p>No one restored the timeline, we are in timeline C now (A being Legacy dying with Young Legacy stepping up, B being Young Legacy dying leading to Iron Legacy). Something happened to the multiverse and allowed Timeline B to intersect with &#39;our&#39; timeline, leading to a future where neither of the Legacies died (as relayed in the Beacon Tactics update).</p><p>We still have no idea what weakened the fabric of reality to allow this, but wild speculation is that it is to be the &#39;big boss&#39; of the Sentinels&#39; card game.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I think repair is the wrong word, replace might be better.</p>",
